- op: discuss  # 6e9d
  at: '2026-11-01T02:26:27Z'  # 6e9d
  by: agent  # 6e9d
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 6e9d
  clock: 4  # 6e9d
  nonce: 6e9d  # 6e9d
  message: "Fixed in PR #1983 (695a28148a on dev). Root cause: every circom name went through resolver.lookup(bare) against a last-wins registry. Pass 2 now resolves through one _CircomScope: signals, params and vars in their own template, a component access c.in / c[i].out only in the bound template, callees same file then include-reachable then unique, includes to real file nodes. Live repro on merged dev: hypergumbo survey on templates A and B each with out <== in, and C with component c = B(): rc=0, A references only a.circom:4-4:in and 5-5:out (its own), B only 10-10 and 11-11, C reaches B in/out through c (before: A referenced B signals, A own got none, c.in/c.out gave no edge). Tests: 12 in test_circom.py (9 of 10 red before). Corpus circomlib: references to never-instantiated files 696 to 0, dangling imports 149 to 0. WI-volat is not fixed by this. Residual filed: WI-rafin (solidity contract scope)."  # 6e9d
